# HMAC key that signs and verifies SafeMan credential QR payloads (lib/verify.ts).
# The in-repo default is a DEMO key so the static export builds with zero config;
# set a strong random value at build time for production and keep it out of any
# public repository. Because verification runs client-side on a static site, the
# key is public by construction - it proves issuance, not secrecy.
NEXT_PUBLIC_VERIFY_HMAC_KEY=
